sequenceDiagram
    participant H as 宿主
    participant L as Loader
    participant D as 插件 DLL
    H->>L: ScanDirectory(dir)
    L->>L: 枚举 *.meta.json
    L->>D: LoadLibraryW(dll)
    L->>D: GetProcAddress(CreateXxx)
    D-->>L: 接口实例
    L->>D: GetProcAddress(SetPluginLogSink)
    L->>L: 注册到按类型索引的表
